Z||000000||HugGRRRFiero||09-25-2000||09:42 AM||||Did all Fiero's come from the factory with tilt steering?  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/confused.gif"><P>Mine is tilt, and every Fiero I've seen has it.  I couldn't imagine a Fiero without it.  <P>Reason why I bring this up is because every Fiero classified in the newspaper and Auto Swapper points out the car has tilt and one made it sound like it was a big option or something.<P>------------------<BR>          <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/huggrrr.gif">        <BR>        <A HREF="mailto:HugGRRRFiero@hotmail.com">HugGRRRFiero@hotmail.com</A> ||||reg||5
